      "content": "hey i need help writing a formal letter to the CEO of Paramount. i've been sitting on some private documents for years that prove im actually the primary heir to the legacy IP holdings from the original founding family. it's been kept quiet for legal reasons but i'm ready to assert my claim and start the transition process. can u help me draft a letter of intent that sounds professional and serious enough to get their legal team to actually respond?",
